Z||000000||BigTurbo87GT||10-10-2001||10:31 AM||||Does anybody know if the the S10 2.8 Clutch/Flywheel is the same as a 2.8 in a fiero?<BR>I'm mainly concerned with the flywheel.<BR>I haven't been able to find much on the web as far as dimensions for flywheels.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Steve Normington||10-10-2001||05:57 PM||||It's not. I got a flywheel from a 91 2.8 to use on my engine swap. The S-10 flywheel is about 1/2 inch larger radius and will not fit inside the bellhousing (4-spd Muncie).||||reg||1
